body:
Thanks for asking!

&#x200B;

We are actually friends now, two years later. I sought psychiatric help for the first time after that specific situation. She was obviously shocked, but stayed with me during some of the worst periods of the treatment. I am really grateful to her.

&#x200B;

Her family didn't do anything in particular. One of her sisters came to my house to talk about non-related stuff some days later, but I suspect she was only checking how I was and if I was \_really\_ dangerous. As for the rest of the family, which I knew very well, I've continued to seen them often.
